        "created_at": "2011-09-16T13:05:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am most curious about Ra’s nemesis. Will it be Apep (<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apep\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apep</a>) the evil snake god of darkness? Or Anubis? (who isn’t evil in Egyptian mythology but is the god if the dead and jackals are cool and since when did comics make sense?) Or maybe a rival archaeologist who has developed  and intends to ? Or maybe they’ll go the tack of making Ra’s rival from the Hellenistic pantheon?</p>",
